"entity": {
"name": "Graham Holdings Co.",
"description": "Graham Holdings Co. is a holding company, which engages in the provision of education and media services. It operates through the following segments: Kaplan International, Kaplan Higher Education, Kaplan Supplemental Education, Television Broadcasting, CSI, Manufacturing, and Automotive. The Television Broadcasting segment owns seven television stations located in Houston, Detroit, Orlando, San Antonio, Jacksonville, and Roanoke, and Social News Desk. The CSI segment is a nationwide specialty home infusion pharmacy licensed in 50 states serving patients suffering from chronic and rare illness. The company was founded by Stilson Hutchins in 1877 and is headquartered in Arlington, VA.",
